            "detailed_description": "Strap into the cockpit of your Arduxim fighter and take on enemy starships in this first-person tactical space shooter. Navigate through dangerous ice crystal fields, take hyper gates to other systems, take on enormous capital ships and more.<br><br>Includes:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A fourteen mission story based campaign covering your first tour of duty on the front lines<br></li><li>Multiplayer to test your skills against other pilots and AI bots<br></li><li>Survival/horde challenge mode with online leader board<br></li><li>Tutorial<br></li><li>Practice mode</li></ul><br>Starfighter Arduxim requires motion controllers, a gamepad, joystick or HOTAS. Controls are fully customisable.",
